{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-volga-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"volga-tower","about":"Welcome to Volga Tower  at Jumeirah Village Triangle, where elevated living meets modern luxury. Discover fully furnished apartments ranging from 1 to 4 bedrooms, each featuring a private pool. Experience a lifestyle of opulence and ease in the heart of this exquisite residence. Relish the tranquility of your personal pool while enjoying the comfort of your thoughtfully designed home. Volga Tower JVT by Tiger Properties brings your dream of lavish living with unmatched convenience to life.Among its remarkable attributes are a wealth of amenities and water features, meticulously crafted to provide residents with a vibrant and sustainable urban lifestyle. Enjoy access to a striking swimming pool, a well-appointed gymnasium, dedicated cycling and fitness tracks, nearby supermarkets for hassle-free shopping, and a variety of dining options. The community even boasts an on-site school, ensuring educational facilities are within reach. With sports courts available, it's the perfect place for families to flourish.This residential development presents a promising investment opportunity in Dubai's thriving real estate landscape. As the demand for premium living spaces continues to rise, Volga Tower JVT stands as a compelling choice for investors seeking both capital growth and a lavish lifestyle.","price":1600000,"title":"Volga Tower","bitrix":{"id":305,"pf_id":"are.2.13228","source":null,"project_id":"Volga Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Volga Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Tiger Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/volga_towe_feature_ef41ae9b0c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/volga_towe_feature_ef41ae9b0c.webp"}],"status":"pendin